        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "673218bf-41c1-5c17-8d9e-d273445b7199",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 603,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.50.050:block:2",
          "start": 487
        },
        "quote": "(1) The street is not a major thoroughfare, major trafficway or through-street designated in the master street plan;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.50.050:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.50.050 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "87541049-0c71-5be0-aa2b-437c6096c534",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 793,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.50.050:block:3",
          "start": 604
        },
        "quote": "(2) The plans do not include cutting or removing of curbing within 20 feet of the property line extended at the intersection of two streets unless approved by the City Engineer or designee;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.50.050:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.50.050 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "36d6c593-62ac-5d05-8f30-3e987673cee2",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1036,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.50.050:block:4",
          "start": 794
        },
        "quote": "(3) The interior of the area to be protected by a curb adjacent to the sidewalk and at either end of the area is sufficiently high and wide to prevent encroachment or standing of any vehicle upon the sidewalk or unpaved area adjacent thereto;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.50.050:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.50.050 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "794a3659-1dbb-5216-b84e-e3a6d8a20688",
